{"t":"RBRK","made":"2026-11-25 03:52","name":"Rubrik, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","employees":3797,"hq":"Palo Alto, CA, United States","website":"https://www.rubrik.com","summary_en":"Rubrik, Inc. provides data security solutions to individuals and businesses worldwide. The company offers enterprise data protection, unstructured data protection, cloud data protection, SaaS data protection solutions, and identity provider services protection; data threat analytics; data security posture; identity recovery and resilience services; and cyber recovery solutions. It also provides RUBY, an AI agent for cyber resilience designed to scale data security operations through automation; SENTRYAI, a proprietary AI deep learning-based platform for system health monitoring; and RUBRIK UNIVERSITY, which includes instructor-led training with hands-on labs, on-demand e-learning courses, and certification exams, as well as offers cloud services. It serves financial, retail, trade, transportation, energy, industrial, healthcare and life science, education, technology, media, communications, services, and public sectors. Rubrik, Inc. has strategic collaboration with MEDITECH to offer native cyber resilience to MEDITECH self-hosted cloud and on-premises solutions. Rubrik, Inc. was formerly known as Scaledata, Inc. and changed its name to Rubrik, Inc. in October 2014. The company was incorporated in 2013 and is based in Palo Alto, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Rubrik, Inc.는 전 세계 개인과 기업에 데이터 보안 솔루션을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 엔터프라이즈 데이터 보호, 비정형 데이터 보호, 클라우드 데이터 보호, SaaS 데이터 보호 솔루션 및 ID 공급자 서비스 보호를 제공합니다. 데이터 위협 분석; 데이터 보안 상태; 신원 복구 및 탄력성 서비스; 및 사이버 복구 솔루션. 또한 자동화를 통해 데이터 보안 운영을 확장하도록 설계된 사이버 탄력성을 위한 AI 에이전트인 RUBY도 제공합니다. 시스템 상태 모니터링을 위한 독점 AI 딥 러닝 기반 플랫폼인 SENTRYAI; RUBRIK UNIVERSITY에는 실습 랩, 주문형 전자 학습 과정, 인증 시험을 포함한 강사 주도 교육이 포함되어 있으며 클라우드 서비스도 제공됩니다. 금융, 소매, 무역, 운송, 에너지, 산업, 의료 및 생명 과학, 교육, 기술, 미디어, 통신, 서비스 및 공공 부문에 서비스를 제공합니다. Rubrik, Inc.는 MEDITECH 자체 호스팅 클라우드 및 온프레미스 솔루션에 기본 사이버 탄력성을 제공하기 위해 MEDITECH와 전략적 협력을 맺고 있습니다. Rubrik, Inc.는 이전에 Scaledata, Inc.로 알려졌으며 2014년 10월에 Rubrik, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. 이 회사는 2013년에 법인화되었으며 캘리포니아주 팔로알토에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":111.97,"mcap":23046623232.0,"pe":null,"fpe":144.4327,"peg":null,"ps":14.944204,"pb":-46.46058,"ev_ebitda":-87.271,"div":0.0,"beta":1.081,"hi52":139.92,"lo52":42.25},"fin":{"rev":1542178048.0,"rev_g":0.379,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.80206,"op":-0.18312,"net":-0.16498,"roe":null,"fcf":479817376.0,"cash":1747649024.0,"debt":1149586048.0,"de":null,"eps":-1.27,"feps":0.77524},"own":{"short":0.0792,"inst":0.85365,"insider":0.02306},"analyst":{"n":28,"mean":125.21429,"median":120.0,"high":155.0,"low":110.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.13793,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":25,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":25,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":25,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":25,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-12","Firm":"Mizuho","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":125.0,"priorPriceTarget":112.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":155.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-26","Firm":"Wedbush","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":150.0,"priorPriceTarget":120.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-23","Firm":"Baird","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":139.0,"priorPriceTarget":130.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-31","Firm":"CIBC","ToGrade":"Outperformer","FromGrade":"Outperformer","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"R